{"id":"n24900-1-7","stage":5,"title":"장차 · 将来","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24900-1-7-1","ko":"이곳을 그만두시면 장차 어디로 가실 생각이십니까?","zh":"如果您离开这里，打算以后去哪儿呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이곳을","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"이곳：这里，这儿；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"이곳","audio":"/audio/f7b06733762a4646c18b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71130","senseId":"1","lemma":"이곳","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이곳을","audio":"/audio/43a4b90de9db10c0ad72.mp3"}},{"text":"그만두시면","meaning":"罢休，放弃","explanation":"그만두다：罢休，放弃；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"그만두다","audio":"/audio/55dca49e4d54e352750e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62318","senseId":"2","lemma":"그만두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그만두시면","audio":"/audio/79447f4dbe8f962f0965.mp3"}},{"text":"장차","meaning":"将来，将要","explanation":"장차：将来，将要","readings":[{"term":"장차","audio":"/audio/9bd724ef825ddf7183b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24900","senseId":"1","lemma":"장차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"장차","audio":"/audio/9bd724ef825ddf7183b8.mp3"}},{"text":"어디로","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디로","audio":"/audio/0fbbfd5af1ab3c98e173.mp3"}},{"text":"가실","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가실","audio":"/audio/6d59b05351b378ca9771.mp3"}},{"text":"생각이십니까?","meaning":"想，决定","explanation":"생각：想，决定；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㅂ니까：正式礼貌的疑问句末。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"4","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생각이십니까","audio":"/audio/41f7cde3eaffce266ddd.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f7b06733762a4646","term":"이곳","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/f7b06733762a4646c18b.mp3","entryId":"71130","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["이곧"]},{"id":"55dca49e4d54e352","term":"그만두다","zh":"罢休，放弃","audio":"/audio/55dca49e4d54e352750e.mp3","entryId":"62318","definition":"不做打算以后要做的事情。","pronunciation":["그만두다"]},{"id":"9bd724ef825ddf71","term":"장차","zh":"将来，将要","audio":"/audio/9bd724ef825ddf7183b8.mp3","entryId":"24900","definition":"在今后；在未来。","pronunciation":["장차"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"6ac12a8f8e4e4c22","term":"생각","zh":"想，决定","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3","entryId":"58162","definition":"在心里决意要做某事；或指想做某事的那种决心。","pronunciation":["생각"]}],"audio":"/audio/dd2f915ff7cc8a60fcb2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24900-1-7-2","ko":"글쎄, 이제 차차 생각해 봐야지.","zh":"嗯，还得慢慢考虑看看。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"글쎄,","meaning":"也许吧，或许吧，难说","explanation":"글쎄：也许吧，或许吧，难说","readings":[{"term":"글쎄","audio":"/audio/7ca52d3e5ceed208124e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29723","senseId":"1","lemma":"글쎄","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"글쎄","audio":"/audio/7ca52d3e5ceed208124e.mp3"}},{"text":"이제","meaning":"今后","explanation":"이제：今后","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61172","senseId":"2","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}},{"text":"차차","meaning":"慢慢地","explanation":"차차：慢慢地","readings":[{"term":"차차","audio":"/audio/36a29ebd31b36350b378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37246","senseId":"2","lemma":"차차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"차차","audio":"/audio/36a29ebd31b36350b378.mp3"}},{"text":"생각해","meaning":"想，考虑","explanation":"생각하다：想，考虑；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"생각하다","audio":"/audio/6ffd015ff4c3322ac70c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66376","senseId":"3","lemma":"생각하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생각해","audio":"/audio/ef94867b7401a550a940.mp3"}},{"text":"봐야지.","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；어야지：表达应当如此、决心或提醒，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐야지","audio":"/audio/1a7203d9a2c046b42ef1.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7ca52d3e5ceed208","term":"글쎄","zh":"也许吧，或许吧，难说","audio":"/audio/7ca52d3e5ceed208124e.mp3","entryId":"29723","definition":"对于对方所提出的问题或要求，表现出不确定的态度。","pronunciation":["글쎄"]},{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"今后","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"61172","definition":"从今以后。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"36a29ebd31b36350","term":"차차","zh":"慢慢地","audio":"/audio/36a29ebd31b36350b378.mp3","entryId":"37246","definition":"不慌不忙，等以后慢慢地。","pronunciation":["차차"]},{"id":"6ffd015ff4c3322a","term":"생각하다","zh":"想，考虑","audio":"/audio/6ffd015ff4c3322ac70c.mp3","entryId":"66376","definition":"很想做某事或对某事感兴趣。","pronunciation":["생가카다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e4d0a6a2c0557ca36375.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.444,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=24900","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license"